#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:2
msgid "Socket objects"
msgstr "套接字对象"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Python interface to the transport layer is the :class:`socket.socket` "
"class. A *socket* represents one endpoint of a network conversation -- an "
"address, a port, and the protocol (UDP or TCP) the conversation runs over. "
"The hardware control chapters opened :class:`~machine.UART` instances to "
"talk on a wire; this section opens :class:`~socket.socket` instances to talk"
" on the network. The shape is the same; the underlying service is just a lot"
" more capable."
msgstr ""
"传输层的 Python 接口是 :class:`socket.socket` 类。一个\\ *套接字*\\ "
"代表一次网络会话的一个端点——一个地址、一个端口，以及该会话所基于的协议（UDP 或 TCP）。硬件控制章节打开 "
":class:`~machine.UART` 实例来在导线上通信；本节则打开 :class:`~socket.socket` "
"实例来在网络上通信。形态是相同的；只是底层服务的能力要强大得多。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:15
msgid "Creating a socket"
msgstr "创建套接字"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:17
msgid ""
"Three arguments describe a socket: which *address family* it speaks, which "
"*socket type* it offers, and which *protocol* it uses. The defaults cover "
"the cases the rest of this section uses::"
msgstr ""
"描述一个套接字需要三个参数：它使用哪种\\ *地址族*\\ 、提供哪种\\ *套接字类型*\\ ，以及使用哪种\\ *协议*\\ "
"。其默认值涵盖了本节其余部分所用到的情形::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:27
msgid "The two constants the application picks between in almost every case:"
msgstr "应用程序在几乎所有情形下都会从中二选一的两个常量："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:30
msgid ""
":data:`~socket.AF_INET` -- IPv4 addresses (a numeric IP plus a port). The "
"most common choice. :data:`~socket.AF_INET6` is the IPv6 equivalent."
msgstr ""
":data:`~socket.AF_INET` ——IPv4 地址（一个数字 IP 加上一个端口）。最常见的选择。\\ "
":data:`~socket.AF_INET6` 是其 IPv6 等价物。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:33
msgid ""
":data:`~socket.SOCK_STREAM` -- a TCP connection, the reliable byte stream. "
":data:`~socket.SOCK_DGRAM` is the UDP equivalent."
msgstr ""
":data:`~socket.SOCK_STREAM` ——一个 TCP 连接，即可靠的字节流。\\ "
":data:`~socket.SOCK_DGRAM` 是其 UDP 等价物。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:37
msgid ""
"The third argument (the *protocol*) is left at zero, which picks the right "
"default based on the first two. The full constructor is documented on "
":doc:`/library/socket`."
msgstr ""
"第三个参数（即\\ *协议*\\ ）保留为零，这会根据前两个参数选取正确的默认值。完整的构造函数文档见 :doc:`/library/socket`\\"
" 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:43
msgid "Addresses on a socket"
msgstr "套接字上的地址"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:45
msgid "A socket address is a tuple of ``(host, port)``::"
msgstr "套接字地址是一个 ``(host, port)`` 元组::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:50
msgid ""
"The host is the IP address as a string. The port is the 16-bit integer "
"covered on :doc:`../transport/ports`."
msgstr "host 是以字符串形式表示的 IP 地址。port 是 :doc:`../transport/ports` 中介绍的 16 位整数。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:53
msgid "A handful of *special* host strings are worth knowing:"
msgstr "有少数几个\\ *特殊*\\ 的主机字符串值得了解："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:55
msgid ""
"``\"0.0.0.0\"`` means \"every IPv4 interface on this device\". A server "
"bound to this address accepts connections on any address the camera holds."
msgstr "``\"0.0.0.0\"`` 表示“本设备上的每一个 IPv4 接口”。绑定到该地址的服务器会在摄像头所持有的任意地址上接受连接。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:58
msgid ""
"``\"127.0.0.1\"`` is *localhost* -- traffic to it never leaves the device. "
"Useful for testing."
msgstr "``\"127.0.0.1\"`` 是\\ *本地回环*\\ （localhost）——发往它的流量永远不会离开本设备。在测试时很有用。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:60
msgid ""
"``\"255.255.255.255\"`` is the local broadcast address. A UDP datagram sent "
"to it goes to every device on the local segment."
msgstr "``\"255.255.255.255\"`` 是本地广播地址。发往它的 UDP 数据报会发送给本地网段上的每一个设备。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:64
msgid ""
"Domain names like ``\"example.com\"`` are *not* valid host strings in a "
"socket address. They have to be resolved to an IP first; :doc:`../names/dns`"
" covers the :func:`~socket.getaddrinfo` call that does that."
msgstr ""
"诸如 ``\"example.com\"`` 这样的域名在套接字地址中\\ *不是*\\ 有效的主机字符串。它们必须先被解析为 IP；\\ "
":doc:`../names/dns` 介绍了完成此事的 :func:`~socket.getaddrinfo` 调用。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:70
msgid "The two roles"
msgstr "两种角色"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:72
msgid ""
"The lifecycle of a socket depends on which side of the conversation it is "
"on. A *client* socket calls :meth:`~socket.socket.connect` (or, for UDP, "
"just :meth:`~socket.socket.sendto`) to talk to a known server. A *server* "
"socket calls :meth:`~socket.socket.bind` to claim a port, then either "
":meth:`~socket.socket.listen` and :meth:`~socket.socket.accept` (for TCP) or"
" :meth:`~socket.socket.recvfrom` (for UDP) to receive incoming traffic."
msgstr ""
"套接字的生命周期取决于它处于会话的哪一侧。\\ *客户端*\\ 套接字调用 :meth:`~socket.socket.connect`\\ （对 "
"UDP 而言，则只需 :meth:`~socket.socket.sendto`\\ ）来与一个已知的服务器通信。\\ *服务器*\\ 套接字调用 "
":meth:`~socket.socket.bind` 来占用一个端口，然后通过 :meth:`~socket.socket.listen` 和 "
":meth:`~socket.socket.accept`\\ （用于 TCP）或 :meth:`~socket.socket.recvfrom`\\ "
"（用于 UDP）来接收传入的流量。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:83
msgid ""
"The same :class:`~socket.socket` constructor is used in both cases; only the"
" methods called afterwards differ. The next three pages walk through the "
"practical patterns:"
msgstr ""
"两种情形使用的都是同一个 :class:`~socket.socket` 构造函数；只是此后所调用的方法不同。接下来的三个页面将逐一讲解实际的模式："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:87
msgid ":doc:`udp-sockets` -- send and receive datagrams."
msgstr ":doc:`udp-sockets` ——发送和接收数据报。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:88
msgid ":doc:`tcp-sockets` -- TCP client and server."
msgstr ":doc:`tcp-sockets` ——TCP 客户端与服务器。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:89
msgid ""
":doc:`async-sockets` -- everything above, but inside an :mod:`asyncio` event"
" loop."
msgstr ":doc:`async-sockets` ——以上全部内容，但置于 :mod:`asyncio` 事件循环之中。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:93
msgid "Closing a socket"
msgstr "关闭套接字"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:95
msgid ""
"Every socket holds a small piece of operating-system state (a port "
"reservation, buffers, the connection's TCP state). When the application is "
"done with it, :meth:`~socket.socket.close` releases that state. A forgotten "
"socket is a slow leak that adds up; in a loop that opens connections, "
"missing a ``close`` will eventually exhaust the cam's pool of available "
"sockets."
msgstr ""
"每个套接字都持有一小块操作系统状态（一个端口预留、若干缓冲区、该连接的 TCP 状态）。当应用程序用完它后，\\ "
":meth:`~socket.socket.close` 会释放这块状态。被遗忘的套接字是一种会日积月累的缓慢泄漏；在一个不断打开连接的循环里，遗漏 "
"``close`` 最终会耗尽摄像头可用套接字的资源池。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:103
msgid "The cleanest pattern is the :keyword:`with` statement::"
msgstr "最简洁的模式是使用 :keyword:`with` 语句::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:111
msgid ""
"Sockets implement the context-manager protocol covered in the Python "
"overview, so the ``with`` block guarantees ``close()`` is called regardless "
"of whether the block exited normally or by raising an exception."
msgstr ""
"套接字实现了 Python 概览中介绍的上下文管理器协议，因此 ``with`` 代码块保证无论该代码块是正常退出还是因抛出异常而退出，都会调用 "
"``close()``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:117
msgid "The :mod:`socket` reference"
msgstr ":mod:`socket` 参考"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/sockets/socket-objects.rst:119
msgid ""
"This and the next pages walk through the API in narrative form. For the full"
" argument-level reference of every method, every flag, and every constant "
"the module exposes, see :doc:`/library/socket`. The reference is also the "
"place to look for the less-common operations (socket options, multicast "
"group membership, IPv6 scope IDs) that this section does not cover."
msgstr ""
"本页和接下来的几页以叙述的形式逐一讲解该 API。如需该模块所暴露的每个方法、每个标志和每个常量的完整参数级参考，请参阅 "
":doc:`/library/socket`\\ 。该参考也是查阅本节未涉及的较不常见操作（套接字选项、多播组成员、IPv6 作用域 ID）的地方。"
